1
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,230
It is true what they say:
俗話說得沒錯 

2
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:08,200
Pregnant bellies look like a drum.
肚子大當鼓打

3
00:00:12,110 --> 00:00:16,700
I'm so pregnant that my guitar doesn't fit anymore.
我已經腫到不能拿吉他

4
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:19,440
So I'm going to play my songs on this drum.
所以生產前我打算用鼓伴奏 

5
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:21,550
It sounds really cool!
聽起來超酷的

6
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:24,050
Listen,listen.
你們聽

7
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:29,120
Smelly cat,smelly cat
臭臭貓，臭臭貓 

8
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:32,760
What are they feeding you?
他們餵你吃什麼？

9
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:39,990
That sounds great!
菲比，太吊了

10
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:43,570
I know! And I've only been playing for an hour.
我知道！而且我才練了1小時

11
00:00:45,812 --> 00:00:47,837
菲比…

12
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:52,440
-What are you doing here? -I came to ask you a big favor.
你怎麼來了？ 我來請你幫個大忙

13
00:00:53,450 --> 00:00:56,380
Don't tell me you want to keep more stuff in my uterus.
別說你還想塞東西進來

14
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:01,780
Okay. Now,see.
不…是這樣的

15
00:01:02,490 --> 00:01:04,720
I want to name the girl baby Leslie.
我想幫女孩取名萊絲莉

16
00:01:04,960 --> 00:01:08,660
And Frank wants to name one of the boy babies...
法蘭克想叫其中一個男孩 

17
00:01:08,930 --> 00:01:10,560
...Frank Jr.,Jr.
法蘭克二世二世

18
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,830
Wouldn't that be Frank lll?
那不就是法蘭克三世？ 

19
00:01:14,270 --> 00:01:15,900
Don't get me started.
說了我就有氣

20
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:20,730
Anyway,since there are three babies...
既然有三個寶寶 

21
00:01:20,980 --> 00:01:23,470
...and we both got to put our names in...
我們又一人取了一個名字

22
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:28,170
...we would be truly honored if you would name the other boy baby.
我們想請你替另一個男孩命名

23
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:30,080
That's so nice!
好棒喔

24
00:01:31,690 --> 00:01:32,780
Cougar.
美洲獅

25
00:01:34,820 --> 00:01:36,120
Think about it.
你想一下

26
00:01:39,460 --> 00:01:41,430
The One with Rachel's New Dress
本集播出：「姓名學」

00:01:43,460 --> 00:01:44,430
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

27
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:29,640
I left a bra drying in there.
我有一件胸罩還在晾

28
00:02:29,910 --> 00:02:32,570
Will your son think it's yours and be traumatized?
班會不會以為是你的 而心靈受創？

29
00:02:32,750 --> 00:02:36,650
Mommy can have a wife. Daddy can have a bra.
媽咪可以有老婆 爹地就可以有胸罩

30
00:02:37,950 --> 00:02:39,780
It's time to go.
該走了 

31
00:02:39,990 --> 00:02:42,620
See,that clock's a little fast.
不，那個鐘快了一點

32
00:02:42,820 --> 00:02:45,120
We still have 17 minutes.
我們還有17分鐘

33
00:02:45,430 --> 00:02:48,220
What can we do in 17 minutes...
什麼事可以在17分鐘內 

34
00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:49,830
...twice?
做兩次？

35
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:52,890
Well,that's ambitious.
野心真大

36
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:56,130
You can ignore that.
別理它 

37
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,700
That's your son.
是卡蘿帶你兒子來了

38
00:02:57,910 --> 00:03:00,880
Believe me,when he's older, he'll understand.
等他長大一定會諒解

39
00:03:02,740 --> 00:03:04,680
I'll be right there.
羅斯 馬上來

40
00:03:13,190 --> 00:03:15,090
This is Carol and Susan.
艾蜜莉，這是卡蘿和蘇珊

41
00:03:15,290 --> 00:03:18,350
-It's so nice to finally meet you. -You too.
總算見到你了 我也是

42
00:03:18,590 --> 00:03:23,160
-Susan will be in London next week. -I've never been there.
蘇珊下星期要去倫敦拍廣告 對，我好興奮，我沒去過

43
00:03:23,430 --> 00:03:25,190
-I'll show you around. -Great!
我來當地陪 太好了

44
00:03:25,530 --> 00:03:28,660
Also,I was hoping to catch a show. Any suggestions?
我還想看秀，你有什麼建議？

45
00:03:28,940 --> 00:03:30,800
There's tons of terrific stuff.
有很多都很棒…

46
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:32,930
I'll go with you.
我陪你去

47
00:03:33,246 --> 00:03:34,873
對不起

48
00:03:35,510 --> 00:03:37,600
Look at you two bonding.
你們可真聊得來

49
00:03:37,910 --> 00:03:39,540
Making us late for the airport.
去機場都快來不及了

50
00:03:40,380 --> 00:03:41,370
Are you all right?
你沒事吧？ 

51
00:03:41,580 --> 00:03:44,920
It's just us getting along is difficult for him...
他沒事 他不喜歡我們處得來

53
00:03:45,190 --> 00:03:47,420
...because he doesn't like me.
因為他不喜歡我

54
00:03:48,090 --> 00:03:49,580
Come on. That's....
拜託，我…

55
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:51,050
It's true.
沒錯

56
00:04:00,700 --> 00:04:03,330
How did we lose?
沒人對打也會輸？

57
00:04:05,970 --> 00:04:07,770
Do we have a baby name yet?
名字想好了嗎？

58
00:04:07,980 --> 00:04:10,270
No. It's so hard!
還沒，好難喔 

59
00:04:10,580 --> 00:04:12,840
I went through this book and found nothing.
翻這本書也沒收穫

60
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:16,520
I want a name that's really strong and confident.
我想取個勇猛有自信… 

61
00:04:16,820 --> 00:04:18,810
You know? Like...Exxon!
例如愛克爽

62
00:04:20,990 --> 00:04:23,620
It certainly worked for that Valdez kid.
很適合阿拉斯加小孩

63
00:04:25,030 --> 00:04:28,690
You want a strong name? How about The Hulk?
你要勇猛的名字？ 綠巨人如何？

64
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:34,490
I'm not sure about Hulk, but I like a name starting with "The".
綠巨人不太好 不過我喜歡什麼「人」的

65
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:38,270
You want a good name, go with Joey.
想取好名字？就取喬伊

66
00:04:38,470 --> 00:04:40,340
Joey's your pal,your buddy.
喬伊是好朋友，好兄弟

67
00:04:40,710 --> 00:04:43,840
Where is everybody? They're hanging out with Joey!
人都在哪裡？都跟喬伊在一起

68
00:04:44,550 --> 00:04:47,670
If you're going to name him Joey, you should name him Chandler.
要取喬伊，還不如取錢德

69
00:04:49,350 --> 00:04:52,810
Chandler's funny,sophisticated, and very lovable...
錢德風趣、世故，一旦瞭解他

70
00:04:53,020 --> 00:04:55,350
...once you get to know him.
就會覺得他很可愛

71
00:04:56,190 --> 00:04:57,680
Joey's lovable too.
喬伊也很可愛

72
00:04:57,890 --> 00:05:01,490
But with Joey,if you need him, he'll be there.
重要的是當你需要喬伊 他就會出現

73
00:05:01,700 --> 00:05:05,720
Chandler will be there too. He might be a little late...
錢德也會出現，或許會慢一點

74
00:05:06,170 --> 00:05:08,970
...but he'll be there. And he'll bring you cold soda...
不過他一定會出現 他還會帶冰汽水來

76
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:12,330
...if what you need him for is that you're really hot.
如果你找他是因為你很熱的話

77
00:05:13,410 --> 00:05:15,140
What do you say?
你覺得呢？

78
00:05:15,380 --> 00:05:19,750
I like the idea of naming him after someone I love.
跟心愛的人同名的想法很好

79
00:05:20,010 --> 00:05:23,250
Joey and Chandler are both great names.
喬伊和錢德都是很棒的名字

80
00:05:28,990 --> 00:05:30,180
All right,I don't
但是我不… 了

81
00:05:30,430 --> 00:05:32,720
Maybe I'll just name him The Hulk.
或是就叫綠巨人好

82
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:38,490
I shouldn't have mentioned it. I wanted to name my kid that.
我不該提的 我想留給我小孩用

83
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:46,560
If you hoped to sleep with Joshua, which one would you wear?
要是你想跟約書亞上床 會穿哪一件？

84
00:05:46,870 --> 00:05:50,810
It creeps me out choosing other people's sex clothes.
我覺得幫別人挑性感睡衣很怪

85
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:54,140
I'm sorry. I'm just so excited.
對不起，我太興奮了 

86
00:05:54,380 --> 00:05:57,350
I've been waiting for months. I got my hair colored.
我等了好幾個月 我跑去染髮，

87
00:05:57,590 --> 00:06:01,150
I got new sheets. I'm making him a very fancy meal.
換了床單 還幫他煮大餐

88
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:03,090
What am I making him,by the way?
我在煮什麼？

89
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:07,790
A frisee salad with goat cheese and pine nuts...
什錦沙拉，有羊酪、松子

90
00:06:08,060 --> 00:06:11,930
...wild rice,roasted asparagus and salmon en croute.
菰米飯、烤蘆筍和鮭魚麵包丁

91
00:06:12,300 --> 00:06:14,290
I thought I was making him filet mignon.
我不是要做腓力牛排？

92
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:19,570
You decided to make salmon because you had some left over.
本來是，但餐廳的鮭魚有剩 所以你決定煮鮭魚

93
00:06:19,810 --> 00:06:22,970
Then you realized if you bitched, then you would stop cooking...
然後你想到要是你抱怨 「你」就會罷煮

94
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:27,480
...and you would have to make your famous baked potato and Diet Coke.
你就得上烤馬鈴薯加健怡可樂

95
00:06:28,380 --> 00:06:30,610
I really get crabby when I cook.
「我」煮菜時火氣真大

96
00:06:31,090 --> 00:06:33,950
Why go through all this trouble? He's a guy.
你何必這麼麻煩，他是個男人

97
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:37,110
You'd serve the potato and he'd still want to have sex with you.
你上馬鈴薯 他還是會想跟你上床

98
00:06:37,290 --> 00:06:40,190
That is not how I operate.
那不是我的作風

99
00:06:48,870 --> 00:06:51,340
We've got to get a new game.
我們得換一種遊戲

100
00:06:55,110 --> 00:06:57,130
So Emily called last night.
艾蜜莉昨晚打電話來

101
00:06:57,410 --> 00:06:59,900
And now you're giving me the message?
你現在才轉告我？

102
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:07,820
Turns out that Emily is just crazy about Susan.
結果艾蜜莉愛死蘇珊了

103
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:10,920
They're going to the theater together.
她們一起去看戲

104
00:07:11,260 --> 00:07:13,450
They're going to dinner.
她們一起吃晚飯

105
00:07:13,690 --> 00:07:15,860
They're going horseback riding!
她們一起去騎馬

106
00:07:16,930 --> 00:07:19,160
God,Susan is so fun!
蘇珊真會玩

107
00:07:22,700 --> 00:07:25,500
Look,this is just a little too familiar.
這個情節太熟悉了一點

108
00:07:25,770 --> 00:07:28,870
For six months before Carol and I split up...
我和卡蘿分手前整整半年

109
00:07:29,180 --> 00:07:33,310
...all I heard was, "My friend Susan is so smart.
我整天只聽到 「我朋友蘇珊好聰明」

110
00:07:33,510 --> 00:07:37,610
My friend Susan is so funny. My friend Susan is so great."
「我朋友蘇珊好風趣」 「我朋友蘇珊好棒」

111
00:07:38,620 --> 00:07:41,780
You think something could happen between Emily and Susan?
你覺得艾蜜莉和蘇珊 會擦出火花？

112
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:44,890
Hey,they're going to the gym together!
她們一起上健身房耶

113
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:48,050
Two women...
兩個女人…

114
00:07:48,330 --> 00:07:49,960
...stretching!
...劈腿拉筋

115
00:07:51,070 --> 00:07:55,330
They take a steam,things get playful. Didn't you see Personal Best?
她們洗蒸汽浴，開始互相逗弄 你們沒看過「登峰造極」嗎？

116
00:07:55,540 --> 00:07:57,400
No,but I'm gonna!
沒，但我一定要看

117
00:07:59,810 --> 00:08:02,040
Hi! You're crazy.
先生，你瘋了

118
00:08:03,210 --> 00:08:04,970
Emily is straight.
艾蜜莉是異性戀

119
00:08:05,250 --> 00:08:08,680
How do you know? We thought Carol was straight.
你怎麼知道？ 我們原先也以為卡蘿是異性戀

120
00:08:09,820 --> 00:08:12,680
Yeah,definitely. I don't like the name Ross.
我肯定不喜歡羅斯這個名字

121
00:08:16,220 --> 00:08:18,720
What a weird way to kick me when I'm down!
你落井下石的方式還真怪

122
00:08:19,530 --> 00:08:21,930
No,I meant for the baby.
我是說寶寶的名字

123
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:27,020
What's wrong with Ross?
羅斯有什麼不好？

124
00:08:27,570 --> 00:08:31,700
Something like this would never happen to The Hulk,you know.
綠巨人就不會遇上這種事

125
00:08:33,910 --> 00:08:35,380
That's not true.
誰說的

126
00:08:35,580 --> 00:08:40,570
In The Incredible Hulk,number 72, Dr. Bruce Banner found....
「綠巨人」第72集裡 布魯斯班納博士發現…

127
00:08:41,850 --> 00:08:42,840
You know....

128
00:08:43,050 --> 00:08:45,580
Never mind. My girlfriend's a lesbian.
不重要，我女朋友是同性戀

129
00:08:48,220 --> 00:08:52,060
I'm definitely going to go with either Joey or Chandler.
我決定不是喬伊就是錢德

130
00:08:53,190 --> 00:08:54,960
You gotta pick Joey!
你一定要選喬伊 

131
00:08:55,260 --> 00:08:57,730
Name one famous person named Chandler.
有哪個名人叫錢德？

132
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,190
Raymond Chandler.
雷蒙錢德（勒） （著名冷硬派推理小說作家）

133
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:01,630
Someone you didn't make up.
你捏造的人不算

134
00:09:02,470 --> 00:09:05,740
There are no famous Joeys. Except for...
喬伊才沒有名人，除了… 

135
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:07,370
...Joey Buttafucco.
喬伊巴塔富寇

136
00:09:08,910 --> 00:09:11,280
Yeah,that guy really hurt us.
他的確是我們的心頭之痛

137
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:15,640
How about a compromise then? What if it's...
加起來除以二如何？例如…

138
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:17,710
...Chan-no-ey?
錢道伊？

139
00:09:18,150 --> 00:09:21,490
Joey? Think about it. He'll never be President.
喬伊？你想嘛 他絕對當不上總統

140
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:24,160
There will never be a President Joey.
絕對不會出現喬伊總統

141
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,980
I didn't want to bring this up.
聽著，我本來不想提的

142
00:09:27,260 --> 00:09:31,290
Chandler is the stupidest name I've heard in my life!
但錢德是我聽過最蠢的名字

143
00:09:31,500 --> 00:09:34,400
It's not a name! It's barely even a word.
它根本不是名字 連個詞都不是

144
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:36,590
It's like chandelier but it's not!
它有點接近錢包，但又不是

145
00:09:39,010 --> 00:09:42,460
Then,you put it together with Bing and forget about it.
再配上「賓」就更別提了

146
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:46,370
It's a stupid,stupid,non-name!
它是個蠢到爆的非名字

148
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:54,620
You're right. I have a horrible,horrible name.
天哪 你說得對，我的名字爛透了

149
00:09:57,890 --> 00:10:00,660
I'm sorry,man. I'm sorry.
對不起，我不是…對不起

150
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:03,830
So I guess it's Joey then.
所以就是喬伊羅

151
00:10:12,410 --> 00:10:15,170
This is so nice. Thank you for doing this.
真好，謝謝你這麼費心

152
00:10:15,710 --> 00:10:18,410
Please! Cooking soothes me.
別客氣，烹飪能舒緩我的心

153
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,880
So dig in!
吃吧 好

154
00:10:25,390 --> 00:10:28,250
It all looks so good.
看起來都好好吃

155
00:10:31,430 --> 00:10:32,410
Oh,my God.
天哪

156
00:10:32,630 --> 00:10:35,100
I know. My God,this rice is so
我知道，天哪，這個飯好… 

157
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:37,190
I am so good!
我的手藝真好

158
00:10:38,030 --> 00:10:39,470
Behind you.
你後面

159
00:10:40,530 --> 00:10:44,630
They used to live here, and sometimes they migrate back over.
沒事，它們以前住這裡 有時會遷徙回來

160
00:10:45,810 --> 00:10:49,540
Is there some way that they could not be here?
能不能讓它們不要在這裡 

161
00:10:49,780 --> 00:10:52,610
Farm birds really kind of freak me out!
我最怕家禽了

162
00:10:53,786 --> 00:10:56,584
好

163
00:10:57,150 --> 00:10:58,240
Here we go.
出去

164
00:11:02,660 --> 00:11:04,750
There you go!
出去

165
00:11:13,670 --> 00:11:16,400
Hey! How'd you do that?
你們怎麼會敲門？進來

166
00:11:19,770 --> 00:11:21,170
All gone.
都走了

167
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:22,900
So,farm birds,huh?
家禽是吧？

168
00:11:23,610 --> 00:11:26,310
It's my only weird thing,I swear.
我只有這個怪癖，我發誓

169
00:11:26,580 --> 00:11:30,410
I would have told you. I didn't know that they'd be here.
我不知道會有雞鴨 否則我會告訴你

170
00:11:38,190 --> 00:11:40,590
Can I serve you a little
要不要來點…

171
00:11:40,830 --> 00:11:42,090
What?
怎麼了？

172
00:11:42,330 --> 00:11:43,320
Nothing.
沒事

173
00:11:43,530 --> 00:11:46,590
It's just that I know that they're still out there.
只是我知道它們還在

174
00:11:48,470 --> 00:11:51,500
They're across the hall. That's two doors away.
它們在對門，隔著兩道牆

175
00:11:51,770 --> 00:11:55,540
It'll take them a long time to peck their way back over here.
它們得啄很久才能把牆啄穿

176
00:11:57,310 --> 00:11:59,340
That's not funny.
一點也不好笑

177
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:06,120
Would you feel better if we went someplace else?
那要不要換個地方？ 

178
00:12:06,350 --> 00:12:10,220
We could pack this stuff up and go to your apartment.
我們可以把東西打包去你家

179
00:12:10,460 --> 00:12:12,480
They're working on it. It's a mess.
我家正在裝修，一團混亂

180
00:12:12,730 --> 00:12:15,700
I'm staying at my parents' house. We could go there.
不過我們可以去我父母家

181
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:18,530
They're out of town.
你父母家？ 對，他們出國了

182
00:12:19,530 --> 00:12:23,160
It's a huge place, and it's got this gorgeous view.
那裡地方很大，視野很棒 

183
00:12:23,370 --> 00:12:25,130
It'd be very romantic.
會很浪漫

184
00:12:25,570 --> 00:12:28,970
-What do you say? -Yeah,that works.
如何？ 好啊

185
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:33,740
They can smell the fear.
它們聞得出恐懼

186
00:12:37,380 --> 00:12:38,540
How's Ben?
班好嗎？

187
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:41,880
I asked if he wanted to eat. He said no.
我問他要不要吃東西 他說不要

188
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:44,520
I asked if he wanted to sleep. He said no.
我問他要不要睡覺，他說不要

189
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:47,520
I asked what he wanted to do. He said no.
我問他想做什麼，他說不要

190
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:49,530
So he's sweeping.
所以他在掃地

192
00:12:54,900 --> 00:12:56,060
Any word from Susan?
有蘇珊的消息嗎？

193
00:12:56,500 --> 00:12:59,530
She said she's having so much fun with Emily.
她說她跟艾蜜莉玩得很開心

194
00:13:03,040 --> 00:13:06,540
By the by,did it ever occur to you that...
對了，你有沒有想過

195
00:13:06,850 --> 00:13:10,870
...maybe they might be having a little too much fun?
她們或許太開心了一點？

196
00:13:11,090 --> 00:13:12,380
What's too much fun?
什麼叫太開心？

197
00:13:12,590 --> 00:13:16,080
The kind of fun you and Susan had when we were married.
我們結婚時 你和蘇珊的那種開心

198
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:19,450
Oh,my God! You are so paranoid.
天哪，你真會亂想 

199
00:13:19,730 --> 00:13:21,090
Am l?
是嗎？

200
00:13:21,500 --> 00:13:22,620
Am l?
是嗎？

201
00:13:23,530 --> 00:13:27,560
Susan is in a loving, committed relationship.
艾蜜莉我不知道 但蘇珊和我的關係很穩定

202
00:13:27,800 --> 00:13:30,270
Carol,so were we.
卡蘿，我們也是

203
00:13:30,770 --> 00:13:33,470
Just imagine for a moment...
你就想像一下

204
00:13:33,870 --> 00:13:37,400
...that Susan meets someone, and they hit it off.
蘇珊認識了別人 她們一拍即合

205
00:13:37,650 --> 00:13:42,110
They're coming back from the theater, and they stop at a pub for drinks.
她們從劇院回來 去酒吧喝個小酒

206
00:13:42,350 --> 00:13:44,650
They're laughing.
有說有笑 

207
00:13:44,850 --> 00:13:47,150
Someone innocently touches someone else.
有人不經意的碰了另一個人

208
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:49,550
There's electricity.
有火花

209
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:51,620
It's new. It's exciting.
感覺很新鮮，很刺激

210
00:13:51,830 --> 00:13:55,350
Are you saying there isn't the slightest possibility...
你敢說完全沒有可能...

211
00:13:55,630 --> 00:13:57,430
...of something happening?
...出事？

212
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:00,360
-Maybe. -Oh,my God!
或許有 天哪！

213
00:14:00,630 --> 00:14:04,090
I didn't really believe it until you just said it!
聽你一說我才真的信了

214
00:14:08,380 --> 00:14:13,040
None of the other kids believed me, but I swear that duck pushed me.
別的小朋友都不信 但那只鴨子真的推我

215
00:14:14,980 --> 00:14:16,780
This place is fabulous!
這裡真豪華

216
00:14:17,050 --> 00:14:19,880
This is the downstairs living room.
我帶你參觀，這是樓下的客廳

217
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:21,850
There's two living rooms?
有兩個客廳？

218
00:14:22,060 --> 00:14:26,650
Growing up here,this place must have been a real babe magnet.
你一定靠這裡把到很多美眉

219
00:14:26,890 --> 00:14:30,350
It would have been, but my parents just moved here.
應該會，但我父母剛搬來

220
00:14:30,630 --> 00:14:33,900
You should know this place is a real babe magnet.
你可以靠這裡把到很多美眉

221
00:14:34,340 --> 00:14:35,800
Want to make out?
要親熱嗎？

222
00:14:38,140 --> 00:14:42,070
Why don't I put the food in the fridge...
這樣吧，我去把吃的冰起來 

223
00:14:42,340 --> 00:14:44,810
...and we can eat it later?
我們待會再吃

224
00:14:45,010 --> 00:14:47,000
That sounds like a plan.
聽起來不錯

225
00:14:47,210 --> 00:14:50,050
Is there a place that I could go freshen up?
哪裡可以讓我梳洗一下？

226
00:14:50,350 --> 00:14:54,810
Just down the hall and second door to your left.
有，直走左邊第二個門

227
00:14:58,060 --> 00:15:00,990
-Hi,darling. -What are you doing here?
兒子 你們怎麼回來了？

228
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:05,000
-We cut the trip short. -France sucks!
我們提前結束行程 法國爛透了

229
00:15:06,330 --> 00:15:09,930
This may be a little weird, but I've got a date here.
情況有點特殊，我帶了人回來

230
00:15:10,170 --> 00:15:11,160
Say no more.
瞭解 

231
00:15:11,410 --> 00:15:14,700
We'll grab some food,go upstairs and be out of your hair.
我們拿了吃的就上樓不妨礙你

232
00:15:15,110 --> 00:15:17,700
That'd be great. So you didn't get to ltaly?
那就好，所以你們沒去意大利 

233
00:15:17,910 --> 00:15:20,010
Yep. Sucks!
沒有，爛

234
00:15:43,370 --> 00:15:44,930
Hi,you!
你來了

235
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:48,430
Oh,my God!
天哪 

236
00:15:48,640 --> 00:15:51,740
I know. I can do more than cook.
我知道，我不只會做菜

237
00:15:58,820 --> 00:16:01,480
I like her. She seems smart.
我喜歡她，她似乎很聰明

238
00:16:04,860 --> 00:16:07,220
Rachel,my parents.
瑞秋，我爸媽

239
00:16:07,460 --> 00:16:09,520
So nice to meet you.
很高興認識你們

240
00:16:12,300 --> 00:16:17,070
Joshua,that $500 was for groceries.
約書亞 那5百元是給你買日用品的

241
00:16:18,710 --> 00:16:23,540
What,this? Oh,no. That's not what it is.
什麼？這…不，你們誤會了

242
00:16:23,780 --> 00:16:26,040
Okay,I work in fashion.
我在時裝界工作

243
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:28,810
And this is a real dress,actually.
這是正式的洋裝 

244
00:16:30,550 --> 00:16:32,920
They're wearing it in Milan.
米蘭正在流行

245
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:37,250
Part of my job is to wear the clothes and see how people respond.
我也必須試穿衣服 觀察一般人的反應

246
00:16:37,460 --> 00:16:41,090
Then I report back to my superiors at Bloomingdale's.
然後回報給布魯明戴爾的上司

247
00:16:42,630 --> 00:16:45,150
Obviously,in this case...
這次...

248
00:16:45,470 --> 00:16:47,990
...I am going to report back:
...我顯然得回報說

249
00:16:48,240 --> 00:16:51,470
"U.S.A. not ready."
「美國，尚嫌大膽」

250
00:16:52,140 --> 00:16:53,230
Maybe in L.A.
洛杉磯或許可以

251
00:16:54,340 --> 00:16:55,400
There you go!
也對 有道理

252
00:16:55,610 --> 00:16:57,440
Have you kids eaten yet?
你們吃過飯了嗎？

253
00:16:57,640 --> 00:17:02,380
We were going to do that after. I mean,next.
我們想等事後…不是 正要吃

254
00:17:02,580 --> 00:17:05,250
Why don't we all get something to eat?
我們餓死了 大家一起出去吃吧

257
00:17:08,590 --> 00:17:12,460
No use wasting this baby just lying around the house.
也好 穿著它窩在家裡太可惜了

258
00:17:14,460 --> 00:17:16,020
So we'll go eat.
所以我們去吃飯

259
00:17:16,260 --> 00:17:17,920
You'll wear that.
你就穿那樣

260
00:17:18,370 --> 00:17:21,660
We'll be eating and, of course,you'll be wearing that.
你就穿那樣吃飯

261
00:17:24,170 --> 00:17:26,330
I am sorry about what I said.
我為我說的話道歉

262
00:17:26,540 --> 00:17:29,600
Nope,you're right. It is a ridiculous name!
不，你說得對 這個名字太可笑了

263
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:31,430
It's not bad.
也沒那麼糟 

264
00:17:31,650 --> 00:17:32,940
Yes,it is!
當然有

265
00:17:33,980 --> 00:17:36,880
From now on,I have no first name.
從此以後，我沒有名字

266
00:17:38,890 --> 00:17:41,050
You're just Bing?
你就叫賓？

267
00:17:42,990 --> 00:17:44,860
I have no name.
我無名無姓

268
00:17:45,660 --> 00:17:47,820
So what are we supposed to call you?
那我們要叫你什麼？

269
00:17:48,460 --> 00:17:51,450
Okay,for now,temporarily, you can call me...
好，你們就暫時叫我…

270
00:17:52,470 --> 00:17:53,800
...Clint.
克林

271
00:17:55,070 --> 00:17:58,200
No way are you cool enough to pull off "Clint."
你才不夠酷

272
00:17:58,410 --> 00:18:00,670
What name am l cool enough to pull off?
那我可以叫什麼？

273
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:02,660
Gene.
金

274
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:06,670
It's Clint.
克林

275
00:18:06,910 --> 00:18:08,380
It's Clint!
就是克林

276
00:18:09,450 --> 00:18:10,580
Bye,Gene.
金，再見

277
00:18:12,590 --> 00:18:14,320
It's Clint!
是克林，克林

278
00:18:18,290 --> 00:18:20,120
What's up with Gene?
金有什麼不好？

279
00:18:24,060 --> 00:18:26,360
You wore your nightie to dinner?
你穿你的睡衣去吃飯？ 沒錯

280
00:18:26,630 --> 00:18:30,360
The best part was when the waiter spilled water down my back.
最精彩的是 我背後被服務生潑到水時

281
00:18:30,600 --> 00:18:33,440
I jumped up and my boob popped out.
我一跳，咪咪彈了出來

283
00:18:35,140 --> 00:18:37,610
It's all right. I got nice boobs.
沒關係，我的胸型很漂亮

284
00:18:40,410 --> 00:18:42,470
I just picked up a message from Emily.
我剛收到艾蜜莉的留言

285
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:45,980
She and Susan are going to a poetry reading together.
她和蘇珊要一起去讀詩會

286
00:18:46,250 --> 00:18:48,410
-So? -So?
所以呢？ 所以呢？

287
00:18:48,590 --> 00:18:50,320
Poetry?
詩耶？

288
00:18:50,620 --> 00:18:52,620
Susan's gay.
蘇珊是同志…

289
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:55,120
They're being gay together!
她們有志一同

290
00:18:56,230 --> 00:18:57,220
Emily's straight.
艾蜜莉是異性戀 

291
00:18:57,430 --> 00:18:59,400
Oh,wake up!
你醒醒吧

292
00:19:02,570 --> 00:19:04,940
Carol really messed you up.
卡蘿真的把你害慘了 

293
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:06,470
Excuse me?
你說什麼？

294
00:19:06,740 --> 00:19:10,770
She turned you into this untrusting,crazy,jealous...
她害你變成不信任別人 瘋瘋癲癲愛吃醋的...

295
00:19:10,980 --> 00:19:12,040
...sycophant!
...讒臣

296
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:19,740
So I don't know what "sycophant" means, but the rest is right.
我不知道讒臣是什麼 但其他都沒說錯

297
00:19:20,490 --> 00:19:24,050
What are you talking about? I am not a crazy,jealous person.
我哪有瘋瘋癲癲愛吃醋

298
00:19:27,830 --> 00:19:29,130
She's right.
她說得沒錯

299
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:33,130
When we were together,you got upset about Mark,and there was nothing.
以前你老愛吃馬克的醋 其實根本沒事

300
00:19:33,470 --> 00:19:34,660
This makes sense.
太有道理了 才怪

301
00:19:34,900 --> 00:19:36,390
It does not!
當然有道理

302
00:19:36,670 --> 00:19:39,260
In high school, you weren't jealous at all...
高中時你從來沒吃過醋...

303
00:19:39,470 --> 00:19:42,440
...even though all your girlfriends cheated on you.
...即使你每個女友都不忠

304
00:19:44,010 --> 00:19:47,240
So up until '92,'93, he was very trusting.
一直到92、93年 他都很信任別人

305
00:19:47,450 --> 00:19:52,250
Then '94 hit,Carol left him, and bam! Paranoid City!
然後94年來臨，卡蘿離開他 砰！紐約鬼影幢幢

306
00:19:52,590 --> 00:19:53,920
Absolutely!
就是這樣 

307
00:19:54,150 --> 00:19:55,490
This is so fun!
好好玩喔

308
00:19:56,090 --> 00:19:58,520
This is not fun!
一點也不好玩

309
00:19:59,790 --> 00:20:02,320
All we're trying to say is...
我們只想說...

310
00:20:02,530 --> 00:20:07,020
...don't let what happened with Carol ruin what you've got with Emily.
...別讓你和卡蘿的事 破壞你和艾蜜莉的感情

311
00:20:08,470 --> 00:20:10,460
The '92 Ross wouldn't.
92年的羅斯就不會

312
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:19,010
I still think I was right about that Mark thing.
我還是覺得馬克一定有問題

313
00:20:20,510 --> 00:20:23,710
Well,you know what? I hope Emily is a lesbian.
什麼？你知道嗎？ 我希望艾蜜莉是同志

314
00:20:29,390 --> 00:20:30,820
Drumroll.
擊鼓

316
00:20:33,790 --> 00:20:35,190
All right.
好…

317
00:20:35,800 --> 00:20:36,790
Help!
幫個忙

318
00:20:37,230 --> 00:20:40,200
Am I a Mark or a John?
我是馬克還是約翰？

319
00:20:41,130 --> 00:20:43,730
You're not tall enough to be a Mark.
你當馬克不夠高

320
00:20:44,470 --> 00:20:46,870
But you might make a good Barney.
你或許可以當個好巴尼

321
00:20:48,680 --> 00:20:50,010
Look,I am serious.
我是認真的 

322
00:20:50,210 --> 00:20:52,540
Tomorrow at 3:30,I'm going to the courthouse.
明天3點半我就要上法院

323
00:20:52,750 --> 00:20:54,340
You're going through with this?
你真的要改名？

324
00:20:54,550 --> 00:20:57,070
This name has held me back my entire life.
這個名字拖累了我一輩子

325
00:20:57,320 --> 00:21:01,190
It's why kids picked on me and why I never do well with women.
害我被其他小朋友找碴 女人運很差

326
00:21:01,420 --> 00:21:05,220
So tomorrow,I'll either be Mark Johnson or John Markson.
明天4點起我不是馬克約翰森 就是約翰馬克森

327
00:21:06,760 --> 00:21:09,820
You've got problems because of you, not your name!
你的問題在於你，與名字無關

328
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:15,660
This has got to stop! Chandler is a great name.
別再鬧了，錢德這個名字很棒

329
00:21:15,870 --> 00:21:17,340
In fact....
事實上…好

330
00:21:20,240 --> 00:21:24,110
I'm sorry,I know you wanted me to name the baby Joey.
對不起 我知道你希望寶寶叫喬伊

331
00:21:24,380 --> 00:21:27,870
I'm going to name the baby Chandler.
但我要…我要讓他叫錢德

332
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:31,870
Really?
真的？ 

333
00:21:32,090 --> 00:21:34,080
But you have to keep the name too.
對，但你也得保留這個名字

334
00:21:34,450 --> 00:21:36,550
Okay,thanks!
好，謝了

335
00:21:36,790 --> 00:21:38,420
You want to hug it out?
要不要抱一下？ 好

336
00:21:42,130 --> 00:21:45,460
I'm going to go tell Frank and Alice right now!
我現在就去告訴法蘭克他們

337
00:21:46,770 --> 00:21:47,760
Bye,Pheebs!
菲比 再見

338
00:22:09,390 --> 00:22:11,650
-Nice luggage. -I was going to say.
很棒的行李箱 我正要說

339
00:22:17,500 --> 00:22:19,360
I missed you too.
我好想你 我也是

340
00:22:19,570 --> 00:22:23,060
-Thanks,I had a great time. -So did l.
謝謝你，我玩得很開心 我也是

341
00:22:25,040 --> 00:22:26,030
No tongue.
不是舌吻

342
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


343
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000

